description:
Sentech is a company with more than 15 years of activity in the fields of Research and Development, embedded computing, dedicated solutions for signal processing boards and special functions, design of complex components such as antennas and process/measurement controllers and integration of systems and related sensors in the Aerospace and Defence sector.

His expertise concerns:

1 – for the optical domain, the design of electro-optical and integrated laser systems for RISTA missions, geopointing and aiming;

2 – for the RF domain, the design and implementation of Radar scenario simulator and target generator, the design and implementation of integrated DF systems and custom radiogoniometric antennas for special applications and the implementation of advanced Direction Finder algorithms such as Super Resolution, Multipath Signals DOA, Low Signal Noise Ratio DOA;

3 – for the AI domain, the design and implementation of complex multidomain Artificial Intelligence systems, the creation of Neural Networks of various kinds (Recurrent, Convolutional, etc.) for EO/IR/SAR image analysis and the generation of synthetic datasets in the various optical bands (IR and VIS) through the use of latest generation graphic engines for the training of neural networks on classes with unavailable datasets.

It has participated to many Research & Development Projects for Italian MOD and is ISO 9001:2015 certified for design and installation of software and for design, manufacture and installation of electronic equipment.

